H('59.d.7.C',3,"A buffer analysis in natural resource work could find:","Land within a set distance of a stream",["The tallest tree","The price of corn","The weather forecast"],"Buffers create zones around features.")
H('59.d.7.C',4,"Mapping wildlife habitat and pasture together helps managers to:","Plan grazing that protects habitat",["Ignore wildlife","Remove all cattle","Stop mapping"],"Overlay supports land management.")
H('59.d.8.A',3,"A map that shows how soil types vary across a field is a:","Soil map",["Road map only","Star chart","Menu"],"Thematic maps show a single theme.")
H('59.d.8.A',4,"A map showing crop vigor from a drone is a(n):","Remote-sensing image map",["Cookbook","Calendar","Phone book"],"It displays sensor data spatially.")
